              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkethĩwa mũthenya ũsu, Yeova akavũa ngetha yake kuma ũla Ũsĩ ũvingu kũvika kalũsĩ ka Misili; na inyw’ĩ mũkoombanw’a ũmwe na ũmwe, inyw’ĩ ana ma Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
